error[E0516]: accessors require an exported field
 --> $DIR/not-exported.nra:4:9
  |
3 |     let balance: int64 = 0;
  |         ------- 'balance' is declared here without 'export'
4 |         | get: balance;
  |         ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ accessor clause on a field that is not exported
  |
  = note: inside its class a field is always read and written directly, so accessors only apply to access from outside the class
help: export the field
  |
3 |     export let balance: int64 = 0;
  |     +++++++

For more information about this error, try `neura explain E0516`.
